{"id":"29665172e26618b5e831eec09e9aaa0122431186","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"29665172e26618b5e831eec09e9aaa0122431186","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/bright-drivers-remap.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+pnpm now installs dependencies and runs lifecycle scripts from projects on mapped Windows network drives [#17747](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/17747)."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/cli_command/options.rs","lines":["@@ -326,7 +326,7 @@ pub(crate) fn find_workspace_root_dir(dir: &Path) -> Result<PathBuf, WorkspaceRo"," }"," "," fn resolve_real_dir(dir: &Path) -> PathBuf {","-    dunce::canonicalize(dir)","+    pnpm_fs::canonicalize_preserving_mapped_drive(dir)","         .or_else(|_| std::path::absolute(dir))","         .unwrap_or_else(|_| dir.to_path_buf())","         .pipe_deref(pnpm_fs::lexical_normalize)"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/dispatch.rs","lines":["@@ -65,7 +65,7 @@ impl CliArgs {","         }) {","             configure_color(color);","         }","-        let dir = dunce::canonicalize(&self.paths.dir)","+        let dir = pnpm_fs::canonicalize_preserving_mapped_drive(&self.paths.dir)","             .unwrap_or_else(|_| self.paths.dir.clone());","         pnpm_default_reporter::set_progress(self.progress_enabled(true));","         configure_default_reporter(&DefaultReporterSetup {","@@ -132,7 +132,7 @@ impl CliArgs {","         {","             return None;","         }","-        let dir = dunce::canonicalize(&self.paths.dir).ok()?;","+        let dir = pnpm_fs::canonicalize_preserving_mapped_drive(&self.paths.dir).ok()?;","         let mut config =","             self.take_or_load_fast_path_config(&dir, config_overrides, preloaded_config)?;","         if self.report_fast_path_warnings(&config, &dir).is_none()"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/dispatch/configuration.rs","lines":["@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ impl RunAnchors {","     /// becomes `config.dir` (used as the install `lockfileDir`, threaded","     /// into every event's `prefix`).","     pub(super) fn resolve(args: &CliArgs) -> miette::Result<Self> {","-        let dir = dunce::canonicalize(&args.paths.dir)","+        let dir = pnpm_fs::canonicalize_preserving_mapped_drive(&args.paths.dir)","             .into_diagnostic()","             .wrap_err_with(|| {","                 format!(\"canonicalizing the `--dir` argument: {}\", args.paths.dir.display())","@@ -43,7 +43,9 @@ impl RunAnchors {","         let cli_dir = if args.paths.dir_from_command_line {","             dir.clone()","         } else {","-            std::env::current_dir().and_then(dunce::canonicalize).unwrap_or_else(|_| dir.clone())","+            std::env::current_dir()","+                .and_then(|cwd| pnpm_fs::canonicalize_preserving_mapped_drive(&cwd))","+                .unwrap_or_else(|_| dir.clone())","         };","         let manifest_path = pnpm_workspace::project_manifest_path(&dir);","         let global_config = default_pnpm_home_dir::<Host>().unwrap_or_else(|| dir.clone());"],"additions":4,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pre_command.rs","lines":["@@ -232,7 +232,7 @@ fn pins_nothing_to_check(invocation: &Invocation, dir: &Path) -> bool {"," }"," "," fn canonicalize_dir(path: &Path) -> miette::Result<PathBuf> {","-    dunce::canonicalize(path)","+    pnpm_fs::canonicalize_preserving_mapped_drive(path)","         .into_diagnostic()","         .wrap_err_with(|| format!(\"canonicalizing the `--dir` argument: {}\", path.display()))"," }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/main.rs","lines":["@@ -212,6 +212,7 @@ mod team;"," mod test_command;"," mod token;"," mod umask;","+mod unc_project_dir;"," mod undeprecate;"," mod unlink;"," mod unpublish;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/unc_project_dir.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@","+//! A project reached through a UNC path (pnpm/pnpm#17747). The local","+//! `C$` admin share stands in for a network share, so the test is skipped","+//! where that share is not reachable.","+","+#![cfg(windows)]","+","+use command_extra::CommandExtra;","+use pnpm_testing_utils::bin::CommandTempCwd;","+use std::{","+    fs,","+    path::{Component, Path, PathBuf, Prefix},","+};","+","+/// `C:\\dir` as `\\\\localhost\\C$\\dir`, when the admin share serves it.","+fn admin_share_form(path: &Path) -> Option<PathBuf> {","+    let mut components = path.components();","+    let Some(Component::Prefix(prefix)) = components.next() else { return None };","+    let (Prefix::Disk(drive) | Prefix::VerbatimDisk(drive)) = prefix.kind() else { return None };","+    let unc = Path::new(&format!(r\"\\\\localhost\\{}$\\\", drive as char)).join(components.as_path());","+    unc.is_dir().then_some(unc)","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn installs_from_a_unc_working_directory() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } =","+        CommandTempCwd::init().add_mocked_registry();","+    let Some(unc_workspace) = admin_share_form(&workspace) else {","+        eprintln!(\"skipping: {} is not reachable through the C$ admin share\", workspace.display());","+        return;","+    };","+    // The hoisted linker keeps the test to copies: a junction cannot be","+    // created on an SMB share, and a symlink needs a privilege CI may lack.","+    let workspace_yaml = workspace.join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\");","+    let config = fs::read_to_string(&workspace_yaml).expect(\"read pnpm-workspace.yaml\");","+    fs::write(&workspace_yaml, format!(\"{config}nodeLinker: hoisted\\n\"))","+        .expect(\"write pnpm-workspace.yaml\");","+    fs::write(workspace.join(\"package.json\"), r#\"{\"dependencies\":{\"ms\":\"1.0.0\"}}\"#)","+        .expect(\"write package.json\");","+","+    // Without these the default store sits under them, and the drive-based","+    // default that panicked on a UNC working directory is never computed.","+    // `storeDir` above still decides where the store goes.","+    let output = pacquet","+        .without_env(\"PNPM_HOME\")","+        .without_env(\"XDG_DATA_HOME\")","+        .with_current_dir(&unc_workspace)","+        .with_arg(\"install\")","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run pnpm install\");","+","+    assert!(output.status.success(), \"install from {unc_workspace:?} must succeed: {output:?}\");","+    assert!(workspace.join(\"node_modules/ms/package.json\").is_file(), \"ms is installed\");","+    drop(root);","+}"],"additions":54,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/config/Cargo.toml","lines":["@@ -35,7 +35,6 @@ pnpm-workspace-task-scheduler = { workspace = true }"," "," base64 = { workspace = true }"," derive_more = { workspace = true }","-dunce = { workspace = true }"," indexmap = { workspace = true }"," miette = { workspace = true }"," node-semver = { workspace = true }","@@ -53,6 +52,7 @@ libc = { workspace = true }"," [dev-dependencies]"," pnpm-testing-utils = { workspace = true }"," ","+dunce = { workspace = true }"," pretty_assertions = { workspace = true }"," tempfile = { workspace = true }"," tracing-subscriber = { workspace = true }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/config/src/defaults.rs","lines":["@@ -46,10 +46,18 @@ fn get_drive_letter(current_dir: &Path) -> Option<char> {"," "," #[cfg(windows)]"," fn default_store_dir_windows(home_dir: &Path, current_dir: &Path) -> PathBuf {","-    let current_drive =","-        get_drive_letter(current_dir).expect(\"current dir is an absolute path with drive letter\");","-    let home_drive =","-        get_drive_letter(home_dir).expect(\"home dir is an absolute path with drive letter\");","+    // A cwd on a network share that no drive maps keeps the store at the root","+    // of the share, just as a